# Reach Tutorial through the original Title and Prologue skip flow.
# Use fixed 1/60-second ticks with --smoke-frames=600 or higher.
press 0 confirm
press 40 skip
# Tutorial startup should be active in the middle of this interval.
press 450 skip
# Free practice uses the same GameInput and PracticeCommand path as live input.
practice 470 ToggleData
practice 485 BossSpawn
practice 510 SystemOffline
# The spawned Boss finishes its entrance before this command.
practice 590 BossFullBarrage
